<title>ISRAEL: Israel's Osem Q2 net.</title>
<headline>Israel's Osem Q2 net.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Osem Investments Ltd.</p>
<p>			 (In thousands of shekels )</p>
<p>			 Q2 96	 Q2 95	6-MTH 96    6-MTH 95</p>
<p>Revenue		284,657     276,319    599,366     568,795</p>
<p>Operating profit    14,004	19,177     42,394	46,235</p>
<p>Net profit	    11,456	13,218     32,112	33,617</p>
<p>In July, Swiss food giant Nestle SA raised its holding in Osem to 40 percent giving it a controlling stake in Israel's largest publicly traded food manufacturer.</p>
<p>- Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211</p>
</text>
